WEBVTT

00:14:57.498 --> 00:15:01.468
līdz mūža beigām.

00:15:01.468 --> 00:15:03.748
Liels paldies un baudiet konferenci.

00:15:03.748 --> 00:15:08.667
Paldies. Paldies. Paldies. (Aplausi)

00:15:08.667 --> 00:15:11.108
Paldies. Paldies. Paldies. Paldies.

00:15:11.108 --> 00:15:12.286
Paldies.

00:15:14.995 --> 00:15:17.797
Atrodiet ceļu! (Aplausi)